				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The **Browser** manages the user interface, and the **Browsee** manages the content.\n\nAt startup time  {{gtMethod:TheHub class>>startUp}}  an auction selects the most suitable class to be  {{gtMethod:TheHub class>>winningBrowserHubClass}} .   Subclasses can override {{gtMethod:TheHub class>>onStartUpBidToBeBrowser}} to outbid {{gtMethod:TheGlamorousHub class>>onStartUpBidToBeBrowser}}  if they wish to be in control."
			},
